---
layout: content-page.njk
title: Important Dates
pageTitle: Important Dates
description: DSN 2027 deadlines for the Research Track, Industry Track, Disrupt, and workshop proposals, plus conference dates.
permalink: /important-dates/
---

<p>Current dates are listed below. See each linked page for details. Dates for other tracks will be added when announced.</p>
<p>Past dates are crossed out after their final calendar day has ended anywhere on Earth (UTC−12).</p>

{% for group in importantDates %}
  <h2><a href="{{ group.url }}">{{ group.title }}</a></h2>
  {% if group.timezone %}
    <p><em>{{ group.timezone }}</em></p>
  {% endif %}
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th scope="col">Date</th>
        <th scope="col">Milestone</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      {% for item in group.dates %}
        <tr>
          <td><time datetime="{{ item.date }}" data-end-date="{{ item.endDate or item.date }}">{{ item.label }}</time></td>
          <td>{{ item.milestone }}</td>
        </tr>
      {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>
{% endfor %}

<script src="/assets/important-dates.js" defer></script>
